[[:db/cas 17592186056215 :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 0 & \\frac{1}{3} & 0 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 2 & -2 & 0 & 4 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0 & 4\\end{bmatrix}" "\\left[\\begin{array}{cccc|c}-1 & 0 & \\frac{1}{3} & 0 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 2 & -2 & 0 & 4 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0 & 4\\end{array}\\right]"] [:db/cas 17592186056216 :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{1}{3} & 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ -4 & 2 & 2 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & 3\\end{bmatrix}" "\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}\\frac{1}{3} & 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ -4 & 2 & 2 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & 3\\end{array}\\right]"] [:db/cas 17592186056217 :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 & \\frac{1}{3} & 0 \\\\ -1 & 2 & -2 & 4 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 3\\end{bmatrix}" "\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 0 & \\frac{1}{3} & 0 \\\\ -1 & 2 & -2 & 4 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 3\\end{array}\\right]"] [:db/cas 17592186056218 :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 & \\frac{1}{3} & 0 & 0 \\\\ -1 & 2 & -2 & 0 & 4 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 1 & 3\\end{bmatrix}" "\\left[\\begin{array}{cccc|c}1 & 0 & \\frac{1}{3} & 0 & 0 \\\\ -1 & 2 & -2 & 0 & 4 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 1 & 3\\end{array}\\right]"] [:db/cas 17592186056219 :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 & \\frac{1}{3} & 0 & -1 \\\\ -1 & 2 & -2 & 0 & 4 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 1 & 3\\end{bmatrix}" "\\left[\\begin{array}{cccc|c}1 & 0 & \\frac{1}{3} & 0 & -1 \\\\ -1 & 2 & -2 & 0 & 4 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 1 & 3\\end{array}\\right]"] [:db/cas 17592186058999 :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}2 & -1 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 2 & 3 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix}" "\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}2 & -1 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 2 & 3 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0\\end{array}\\right]"] [:db/cas 17592186059000 :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}2 & -1 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 2 & 3\\end{bmatrix}" "\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}2 & -1 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 2 & 3\\end{array}\\right]"] [:db/cas 17592186059001 :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}2 & -1 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 2 & -3\\end{bmatrix}" "\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}2 & -1 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 2 & -3\\end{array}\\right]"] [:db/cas 17592186059002 :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -2 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 2 & -3\\end{bmatrix}" "\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & -2 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 2 & -3\\end{array}\\right]"] [:db/cas 17592186059003 :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}2 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 2 \\\\ -1 & 3\\end{bmatrix}" "\\left[\\begin{array}{c|c}2 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 2 \\\\ -1 & 3\\end{array}\\right]"] [:db/cas 17592186059579 :question/worked-solution "First, we organize the system so that the variables are ordered $a,b,c,d$ on the left-hand side, the constants are on the right-hand side, and every variable has a coefficient:\n\n![](images/93/93874fa93cfd9ef3df1492bbc35056c2381157740d8ca26b475474faf54ee4d1.png)\n\nThe coefficient matrix consists of the coefficients of the variables:\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 0 & \\frac{1}{2} & 0 \\\\ -1 & 3 & -4 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 1\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nThe augmented matrix is the coefficient matrix augmented with the column that represents the right-hand sides of the equations:\n\n![](images/83/8356d9148bc06d76a5aee41e4a07651c43d94b2496d9542eb8b6e01ee52ea161.png)" "First, we organize the system so that the variables are ordered $a,b,c,d$ on the left-hand side, the constants are on the right-hand side, and every variable has a coefficient:\n\n![](images/93/93874fa93cfd9ef3df1492bbc35056c2381157740d8ca26b475474faf54ee4d1.png)\n\nThe coefficient matrix consists of the coefficients of the variables:\n\n$$\n\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}-1 & 0 & \\frac{1}{2} & 0 \\\\ -1 & 3 & -4 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 1\\end{array}\\right]\n$$\n\nThe augmented matrix is the coefficient matrix augmented with the column that represents the right-hand sides of the equations:\n\n![](images/83/8356d9148bc06d76a5aee41e4a07651c43d94b2496d9542eb8b6e01ee52ea161.png)"] [:db/cas 17592186059969 :question/problem "What is the augmented matrix for the following system of linear equations?\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\{\\begin{aligned}6x+y+z=4 \\\\ x+z=9\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" "What is the augmented matrix for the following system of linear equations?\n\n$$\\begin{cases}6x+y+z=4 \\\\ x+z=9\\end{cases}$$"] [:db/cas 17592186059969 :question/worked-solution "First, we organize the system so that the variables are ordered $x,y,z$ on the left-hand side, the constants are on the right-hand side, and every variable has a coefficient:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\{\\begin{aligned}6x+y+z=4 \\\\ x+0y+z=9\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe coefficient matrix consists of the coefficients of the variables:\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}6 & 1 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 0 & 1\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nThe augmented matrix  is the coefficient matrix augmented with the column that represents the right-hand sides of the equations:\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}6 & 1 & 1 & 4 \\\\ 1 & 0 & 1 & 9\\end{aligned}]\n$$" "First, we organize the system so that the variables are ordered $x,y,z$ on the left-hand side, the constants are on the right-hand side, and every variable has a coefficient:\n\n$$\\begin{cases}6x+y+z=4 \\\\ x+0y+z=9\\end{cases}$$\n\nThe coefficient matrix consists of the coefficients of the variables:\n\n$$\n\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}6 & 1 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 0 & 1\\end{array}\\right]\n$$\n\nThe augmented matrix  is the coefficient matrix augmented with the column that represents the right-hand sides of the equations:\n\n$$\n\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}6 & 1 & 1 & 4 \\\\ 1 & 0 & 1 & 9\\end{array}\\right]\n$$"] [:db/cas 17592186059972 :question/problem "What is the coefficient matrix for the following system of linear equations?\n\n${-2x + 4y = 20; - x =-13$" "What is the coefficient matrix for the following system of linear equations?\n\n$\\begin{cases}-2x + 4y = 20 \\\\ - x =-13\\end{cases}$"] [:db/cas 17592186059976 :question/problem "What is the augmented matrix for the following system of linear equations?\n\n${\\frac{c}{3} =-a; - 4 + 2b = 2c + a; d = 3$" "What is the augmented matrix for the following system of linear equations?\n\n$\\begin{cases}\\frac{c}{3} =-a \\\\ - 4 + 2b = 2c + a \\\\ d = 3\\end{cases}$"] [:db/cas 17592186060198 :question/problem "What would be the system of equations for the following augmented matrix?\n\n$\\begin{bmatrix}0 & -\\frac{1}{2} & 1 & 0 \\\\ \\frac{1}{2} & -1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 0 & \\frac{1}{2} & 0\\end{bmatrix}$" "What would be the system of equations for the following augmented matrix?\n\n$\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}0 & -\\frac{1}{2} & 1 & 0 \\\\ \\frac{1}{2} & -1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 0 & \\frac{1}{2} & 0\\end{array}\\right]$"] [:db/cas 17592186060201 :question/problem "What is the augmented matrix for the following system of  linear equations?\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}-x+y=5 \\\\ x+y=6\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" "What is the augmented matrix for the following system of  linear equations?\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{cases}-x+y=5 \\\\ x+y=6\\end{cases}\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [:db/cas 17592186060201 :question/worked-solution "Notice that the system is already organized so that the variables are in the order $x,y$ on the left-hand side, the constants are on the right-hand side, and every variable has a coefficient. \n\nThe coefficient matrix consists of the coefficients of the variables: \n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 1\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\n \n\nThe augmented matrix  is the coefficient matrix augmented with the column that represents the right-hand sides of the equations:\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 1 & 5 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 6\\end{aligned}]\n$$" "Notice that the system is already organized so that the variables are in the order $x,y$ on the left-hand side, the constants are on the right-hand side, and every variable has a coefficient. \n\nThe coefficient matrix consists of the coefficients of the variables: \n\n$$\n\\left[\\begin{array}{c|c}-1 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 1\\end{array}\\right]\n$$\n\n \n\nThe augmented matrix  is the coefficient matrix augmented with the column that represents the right-hand sides of the equations:\n\n$$\n\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}-1 & 1 & 5 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 6\\end{array}\\right]\n$$"] [:db/cas 17592186060394 :question/problem "What is the coefficient matrix for the following system of linear equations?\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}-x+y=2 \\\\ x-y=-2\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" "What is the coefficient matrix for the following system of linear equations?\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{cases}-x+y=2 \\\\ x-y=-2\\end{cases}\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [:db/cas 17592186060394 :question/worked-solution "The coefficient matrix consists of the coefficients of the variables: \n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 1 \\\\ 1 & -1\\end{aligned}]\n$$" "The coefficient matrix consists of the coefficients of the variables: \n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 1 \\\\ 1 & -1\\end{bmatrix}\n$$"] [:db/cas 17592186060395 :question/problem "What would be the system of equations for the following augmented matrix?\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}1 & -2 & 10 \\\\ -1 & 1 & -2\\end{aligned}]\n$$" "What would be the system of equations for the following augmented matrix?\n\n$$\n\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & -2 & 10 \\\\ -1 & 1 & -2\\end{array}\\right]\n$$"] [:db/cas 17592186060395 :question/worked-solution "The augmented matrix consists of two parts: the coefficient matrix and the column of constants.\n\nThe coefficient matrix represents the coefficients in the linear system, while the column of constants represents the constants on the right-hand sides of the equations.\n\nUsing the variables $x$ and  $y$,  the corresponding system of equations is\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}x-2y=10 \\\\ -x+y=-2.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "The augmented matrix consists of two parts: the coefficient matrix and the column of constants.\n\nThe coefficient matrix represents the coefficients in the linear system, while the column of constants represents the constants on the right-hand sides of the equations.\n\nUsing the variables $x$ and  $y$,  the corresponding system of equations is\n\n$$\\begin{cases}x-2y=10 \\\\ -x+y=-2.\\end{cases}$$"] [:db/cas 17592186060396 :question/problem "What is the augmented matrix for the following system of linear equations?\n\n${2a - b =-1; a + 2b = 3$" "What is the augmented matrix for the following system of linear equations?\n\n$\\begin{cases}2a - b =-1 \\\\ a + 2b = 3\\end{cases}$"] [:db/cas 17592186060938 :tutorial/content "We can use matrices to solve systems of linear equations. To do this, we need to set up the **augmented matrix** for the system.\n\nAs an example, let's consider the system of equations below.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2x+5y=-1 \\\\ -3x+7y=1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFirst, we find the **coefficient matrix**, which consists of the coefficients of the variables:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2 & 5 \\\\ -3 & 7\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we create the **augmented matrix**. This is the coefficient matrix augmented with the column that represents the right-hand sides of the equations:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2 & 5 & -1 \\\\ -3 & 7 & 1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIn the future, we will learn how to use coefficient and augmented matrices to solve systems of equations. But for now, let's practice setting them up." "We can use matrices to solve systems of linear equations. To do this, we need to set up the **augmented matrix** for the system.\n\nAs an example, let's consider the system of equations below.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\color{red}2}x+{\\color{red}5}y={\\color{blue}-1} \\\\ {\\color{red}-3}x+{\\color{red}7}y={\\color{blue}1}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFirst, we find the **coefficient matrix**, which consists of the coefficients of the variables:\n\n$$\n\\begin{matrix}{\\color{red}2} & {\\color{red}5} \\\\ {\\color{red}-3} & {\\color{red}7}\\end{matrix}\n$$\n\nThen, we create the **augmented matrix**. This is the coefficient matrix augmented with the column that represents the right-hand sides of the equations:\n\n$$\n\\begin{array}{cc|c}{\\color{red}2} & {\\color{red}5} & {\\color{blue}-1} \\\\ {\\color{red}-3} & {\\color{red}7} & {\\color{blue}1}\\end{array}\n$$\n\nIn the future, we will learn how to use coefficient and augmented matrices to solve systems of equations. But for now, let's practice setting them up."] [:db/cas 17592186238184 :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}6 & 1 & 1 & 4 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 0 & 9\\end{aligned}]" "\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}6 & 1 & 1 & 4 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 0 & 9\\end{array}\\right]"] [:db/cas 17592186238432 :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}2 & -5 & 3 \\\\ 6 & 1 & 4\\end{aligned}]" "\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}2 & -5 & 3 \\\\ 6 & 1 & 4\\end{array}\\right]"] [:db/cas 17592186238552 :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}2 & -4 & 0 \\\\ -3 & 1 & 0\\end{aligned}]" "\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}2 & -4 & 0 \\\\ -3 & 1 & 0\\end{array}\\right]"] [:db/cas 17592186238806 :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}1 & 3 \\\\ 2 & 0\\end{aligned}]" "\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 3 \\\\ 2 & 0\\end{bmatrix}"] [:db/cas 17592186238843 :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}6 & 1 & 1 & 4 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 1 & 9\\end{aligned}]" "\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}6 & 1 & 1 & 4 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 1 & 9\\end{array}\\right]"] [:db/cas 17592186239163 :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}1 & 3 \\\\ 2 & 1\\end{aligned}]" "\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 3 \\\\ 2 & 1\\end{bmatrix}"] [:db/cas 17592186239165 :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}1 & 7 & 3 \\\\ 2 & 4 & 0\\end{aligned}]" "\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 7 & 3 \\\\ 2 & 4 & 0\\end{bmatrix}"] [:db/cas 17592186239298 :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}1 & 3 & 7 \\\\ 2 & 0 & 4\\end{aligned}]" "\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 3 & 7 \\\\ 2 & 0 & 4\\end{bmatrix}"] [:db/cas 17592186239309 :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}1 & 7 \\\\ 2 & 4\\end{aligned}]" "\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 7 \\\\ 2 & 4\\end{bmatrix}"] [:db/cas 17592186239705 :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}6 & 1 & 1 & 4 \\\\ 1 & 0 & 1 & 9\\end{aligned}]" "\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}6 & 1 & 1 & 4 \\\\ 1 & 0 & 1 & 9\\end{array}\\right]"] [:db/cas 17592186239747 :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}6 & 1 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 0\\end{aligned}]" "\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}6 & 1 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 0\\end{array}\\right]"] [:db/cas 17592186239838 :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}2 & -3 & 5 \\\\ -4 & 1 & -6\\end{aligned}]" "\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}2 & -3 & 5 \\\\ -4 & 1 & -6\\end{array}\\right]"] [:db/cas 17592186240226 :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}2 & -3 & 5 \\\\ 6 & 1 & 4\\end{aligned}]" "\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}2 & -3 & 5 \\\\ 6 & 1 & 4\\end{array}\\right]"] [:db/cas 17592186240263 :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}6 & 1 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 1\\end{aligned}]" "\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}6 & 1 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 1\\end{array}\\right]"] [:db/cas 17592186240305 :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}2 & 3 & 5 \\\\ 6 & 1 & 4\\end{aligned}]" "\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}2 & 3 & 5 \\\\ 6 & 1 & 4\\end{array}\\right]"] [:db/cas 17592186240971 :question/problem "What is the coefficient matrix for the following system of equations?\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\{\\begin{aligned}x+3y=7 \\\\ 2x=4\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" "What is the coefficient matrix for the following system of equations?\n\n$$\\begin{cases}x+3y=7 \\\\ 2x=4\\end{cases}$$"] [:db/cas 17592186240971 :question/worked-solution "First, we organize the system so that the variables are ordered  $x,y$ \n on the left-hand side, the constants are on the right-hand side, and every variable has a coefficient:\n\n$$\n\\{\\begin{aligned}x+3y=7 \\\\ 2x+0y=4\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe coefficient matrix consists of the coefficients of the variables:\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}1 & 3 \\\\ 2 & 0\\end{aligned}]\n$$" "First, we organize the system so that the variables are ordered  $x,y$ \n on the left-hand side, the constants are on the right-hand side, and every variable has a coefficient:\n\n$$\n\\{\\begin{aligned}x+3y=7 \\\\ 2x+0y=4\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe coefficient matrix consists of the coefficients of the variables:\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 3 \\\\ 2 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\n$$"] [:db/cas 17592186241007 :question/problem "What is the augmented matrix for the following system of linear equations?\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\{\\begin{aligned}2x-5=3y \\\\ 6+y=4x\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" "What is the augmented matrix for the following system of linear equations?\n\n$$\\begin{cases}2x-5=3y \\\\ 6+y=4x\\end{cases}$$"] [:db/cas 17592186241007 :question/worked-solution "First, we organize the system so that the variables are ordered $x,y$ on the left-hand side, the constants are on the right-hand side, and every variable has a coefficient:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\{\\begin{aligned}2x-3y=5 \\\\ -4x+y=-6\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe coefficient matrix consists of the coefficients of the variables:\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}2 & -3 \\\\ -4 & 1\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nThe augmented matrix  is the coefficient matrix augmented with the column that represents the right-hand sides of the equations: \n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}2 & -3 & 5 \\\\ -4 & 1 & -6\\end{aligned}]\n$$" "First, we organize the system so that the variables are ordered $x,y$ on the left-hand side, the constants are on the right-hand side, and every variable has a coefficient:\n\n$$\\begin{cases}2x-3y=5 \\\\ -4x+y=-6\\end{cases}$$\n\nThe coefficient matrix consists of the coefficients of the variables:\n\n$$\n\\left[\\begin{array}{c|c}2 & -3 \\\\ -4 & 1\\end{array}\\right]\n$$\n\nThe augmented matrix  is the coefficient matrix augmented with the column that represents the right-hand sides of the equations: \n\n$$\n\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}2 & -3 & 5 \\\\ -4 & 1 & -6\\end{array}\\right]\n$$"] [:db/cas 17592186241392 :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & -1 & 4 \\\\ -11 & 0 & 3 & -1\\end{aligned}]" "\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 0 & -1 & 4 \\\\ -11 & 0 & 3 & -1\\end{array}\\right]"] [:db/cas 17592186241465 :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}4 & 2 & -3 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -11\\end{aligned}]" "\\begin{bmatrix}4 & 2 & -3 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -11\\end{bmatrix}"] [:db/cas 17592186241493 :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}4 & 2 & -3 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -11 & 12\\end{aligned}]" "\\begin{bmatrix}4 & 2 & -3 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -11 & 12\\end{bmatrix}"] [:db/cas 17592186241697 :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}2 & 4 & 3 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -11 & 12\\end{aligned}]" "\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 4 & 3 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -11 & 12\\end{bmatrix}"] [:db/cas 17592186241708 :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}9 & -3 & 1 & 16 \\\\ -8 & 4 & 0 & -15 \\\\ 20 & -